[05/26 14:17:16     57s] @file 170: ### Sroute  
[05/26 14:17:16     57s] @file 171: # Explanation : Our VDD and GND pads needs to connect to the power rings - otherwise our power rings would just be floating!
[05/26 14:17:16     57s] @file 172: #               The connection in these pads are on layer M6 respectively M7. 
[05/26 14:17:16     57s] @file 173: #               We use the special route to tell the tool to connect the `pad_pins` (i.e., the pin connection of the pads) for the net VDD resp. GND
[05/26 14:17:16     57s] @file 174: #               We also add -inst [..] to only do this for our VDD pads and GND pads.
